Deleted User

The user with the following information has deleted their account:

Email: <%= @user.email %>
Site Admin: <%= @user.site_admin? ? "Yes" : "No" %>
Registration date: <%= I18n.l(@user.created_at, format: :long) %>
Time as user: <%= time_ago_in_words(@user.created_at) %>

Session History:
<% if @sessions.any? %>
  <% @sessions.each do |session| %>
  - Date: <%= I18n.l(session.created_at, format: :long) %>
    IP: <%= session.ip_address %>
    Browser: <%= session.user_agent %>
  <% end %>
<% else %>
No session history available.
<% end %>

This information is sent as a record before the user's data is permanently deleted.